Keys · Tools ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 Tools
  i                      import
  j/k, down/up           move
  tab                    switches
  /                      filter
  ?                      help
  q                      quit
  esc                    back
  right, enter           skills

 Global keys
  1-8                    switch tabs: Sessions, Graph, Quotas, Messages, Tools, Settings, Inbox, Delivery
  enter                  go into the selected thing
  arrows, j/k            move
  esc                    back; first clears a filter you typed
  /                      filter or search
  R                      refresh
  c                      open the CTO session
  C                      focus the CTO box
  ?                      help
  q, ctrl+c              quit

















up/down scroll  ? all screens  esc close
